          "passage": "Women Judges and Magistrates on High Courts, 2009-2013\n2009 2010 2011 2012 20130\n2\n4\n6\n8\n10\nYear\nNumber\nSlovenia\nFinland\nDominican Republic\nA report from an international organization that\nmonitors the numbers of women serving as\njudges or magistrates on various nations' highest\ncourts, such as the Supreme court in Finland\nand the Supreme Court in the Dominican\nrepublic. From 2009 to 2013, the number of\nwomen serving as justices or magistrates on\nhighest courts in most countries increased.\nHowever, there are also countries where the\nnumber decreased or remained unchanged; for\nexample, _______.",
