          "passageTitle": "Command of Evidence - Graphs — Q5",
          "passage": "1,990 1,992 1,994 1,996 1,998 2,000\n0\n10\n20\n30\n40\n50\n60\n70\nYear\nDelay in hours\nAnnual Average Hours of Highway Traffic Delay per Auto Commuter\nNew York City, New York\nBeaumont, Texas\nAllentown-Bethlehem, Pennsylvania\nIn college course on urban affairs, a student\nasserts that increased traffic congestion in the\n1990s in the United States was present both in\nvery large cities such as New York City, New\nYork, and smaller areas such as\nAllentown-Bethlehem, Pennsylvania, and\nBeaumont, Texas: though those smaller areas\nmay have been less affected by traffic congestion\nthan very large cities, this congestion also\nworsened in them over time.",
