            "Run-of-river plant with the highest\naverage annual power generation in the\ntable generates more electricity than the\npeaking plant with the highest annual\npower generation in the table.",
            "average power generated annually by the\nKansas River plant is higher than that\ngenerated by the Scanlon plant."
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is A (Answer Key: Topic 7, Q7). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation.",
          "imageDataUrl": "/packs/satoplam-reading/images/topic7_q7.png",
