            "cobalt constitutes a higher proportion of\nHEA 15 than it does of HEA 7.",
            "cobalt constitutes a substantial proportion\nof HEA 15 but does not constitute any of\nHEA 51.",
            "cobalt constitutes a different proportion of\nHEA 25 than it does of HEA 7."
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is A (Answer Key: Topic 7, Q87). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation.",
